Tyleannar.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Tyleannar''' is a [[Biel-Tan]] [[Farseer]] who led a strike force that successfully destroyed the [[Chaos|corrupted]] [[Craftworld]] [[Lanimayesh]], thus saving it from being permanently claimed by the [[Chaos God]] [[Khorne]]. Before Lanimayesh's destruction, Tyleannar also helped the [[Howling Banshee]]s of the [[Deathly Wail Shrine]] claim the body of their Exarch [[Clyona]], who had died fighting the servants of Khorne on the doomed Craftworld. It was rumoured that the successful completion of his mission would soon lead Tyleannar into being chosen as an [[Autarch]] for his Craftworld.{{Fn|1}}

