{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Tylus Dariyan''' is a [[Raptors (Chapter)|Raptors]] [[Eliminator]] sniper specialist, who is currently a part of the [[Kill-Team]] led by [[Saerys Korvaedyn]].{{Fn|1}}

