Tynas Sabine.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Tynas Sabine''' was a past [[Matriarch Primus]] of [[House Escher]] and is the birth mother of its current ruler, [[Adina Sabine]].{{Fn|1}} 

Her reign, however, infamously came to an end, when Tynas was ousted by the [[House Escher|House]]'s [[Maiden Cult]]. The Cult argued ostensibly that they had done so because Tynas was no longer fit to rule, as she had grown soft after long years of seclusion within the [[Council of Crones]]. Most of House Escher's members, however, knew Tynas was truly targeted by the youth obsessed Cult, because of her disregard of using [[Rejuvenat]] treatments to hide her advance age.{{Fn|1}}

