Tyne.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Tyne''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], also known as ''"[[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt's]] Ghosts"''.{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Tyne was one of the [[Verghast]]ite recruits taken on by the regiment following the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], becoming part of the regiment's [[Imperial Guard Platoon|eleventh platoon]]. His first action after signing on was on the planet [[Hagia]].{{Fn|1}}

Whilst on Hagia, Tyne attempted to give himself a [[tattoo]], as the original [[Tanith]] members of the regiment had tattoos as part of their world's traditions and it was said by many of them that you couldn't be a true Ghost without one. However, he botched the job and his tattoo became infected.{{Fn|1}}

