Tyr (Chaplain).wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Tyr''' was a [[Black Templars]] [[Chaplain]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Over his two hundred and fifty years of service, Tyr was always a specter on the battlefield and the populations of many [[Imperial]] worlds owed their survival to the [[Chaplain]]'s actions. While he repeatedly proved himself to be a hero of the Imperium, Tyr became a legend after he killed an [[Ork]] [[Warboss]] in single combat, during the defense of [[Kray World]]. However his service to the Imperium ended, after the Chaplain was slain while fighting in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|1}} [[Gathrog Campaign]],{{Fn|2}} against the [[Green Kroosade]]'s Ork hordes.{{Fn|1}} 
==Trivia==
