Tyrel Cathek.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Tyrel 'Destroyer' Cathek''' is a small [[Rogue Trader]], with slightly overlong arms.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
An itinerant traveler of the [[galaxy]], he wanders beyond the borders of the [[Imperium]] in his service as a [[Rogue Trader]]. Cathek does not cut an imposing figure, though, and is easily dismissed as harmless by those unaware of his reputation. However once the truth about Cathek is known, no one makes the same mistake twice. For the Rogue Trader would kill just as readily as he would breathe and is ideally suited to his role, as Cathek harbors many psychopathic tendencies. He cannot help destroying those he considers to be a danger to his beloved Imperium and the numbers the Rogue Trader has slain are counted in terms of planetary populations, rather than thousands or millions. As Cathek's decisions to terminate are based on his many deep-seated phobias and prejudices, he has yet to find a world where the inhabitants are not a threat. Currently his retinue includes the [[Space Marine Company|4th Company]] of the [[Stone Hearts]] [[Chapter]] and two [[Imperial Guard Company|Companies]] of the [[Astra Militarum]].{{Fn|1}}

