'''Tytrona Dikaisune''' is an [[Inquisitor]] and is among the few that are stranded within the [[Gilead System]] due to the [[Great Rift]]'s creation. Though the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Jakel Varonius]] has been given guardianship of the [[Gilead System]], Tytrona has made it clear that she has absolute authority wherever the taint of [[Chaos]] emerges.{{Fn|1a}}


