Tyvan.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Tyvan''' is a sublimely skilled [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Shield-Captain]]{{Fn|1b}}, who commands the [[Talons of the Emperor]] [[Guardians of the Throne]] strike force.{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
His every thought is to how to protect the [[Emperor]] and by extension [[Terra]], from dangerous threats. This singular drive{{Fn|1b}} has caused Tyvan to lead the [[Adeptus Custodes]] and [[Sisters of Silence]] under his command, in purging [[heretics]] from one side of the [[Segmentum Solar]] to the other.{{Fn|1a}}

