Ulrech (Captain).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Ulrech''' is a [[Minotaurs]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], who is among the [[Chapter]]'s forces taking part in the [[Indomitus Crusade]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He is with the [[Minotaurs]] serving in [[Battle Group Faustus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group Faustus]], which is taking part in the [[Thranx Purge]] campaign. Their foes are the forces of [[Chaos]], in the [[Bosphori System]], where '''Task Force Faustus III''' later requested additional reinforcements. However before a decision was made, the Battle Group was made aware of a dire Chaos threat that the [[Rogue Psyker]] [[Darian Pellor]] had awakened. After hearing this, the Battle Group's [[Groupmaster]], [[Elena Dhaur-Carriadh]], was advised by Ulrech, [[Canoness]] [[Justyne]], [[Vice Admiral|Vice-Admiral]] [[Graeves]] and '''[REDACTED]''', to not reinforce Task Force Faustus III. Instead, they recommended that '''Task Force Faustus IV''' was formed, in order to deal with Pellor's threat. Dhaur-Carriadh agreed and Justyne is now commanding the Task Force against the Rogue Psyker. Ulrech is also leading a Minotaurs strike force within it.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
