Ulrichit Larzend.wikitext:
{{CollegiaTitanicaPortal}}
'''Ulrichit Larzend'''  was a [[Legio Metalica]] [[Princeps Seniores]], who commanded the [[Warlord Titan]] ''[[Custodire Invidia]]'', during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The Princeps was attached to the [[183rd Expeditionary Fleet]], when his [[Titan Maniple|Maniple]] of [[Imperial Titan|Titans]] became separated during one of its redeployments. The Maniple's drifting ships eventually reached the borders of the [[Saraninent Conglomerate]], a [[Human]] enclave that had not been discovered by the [[Imperium]]. The Conglomerate had long been preyed upon by [[Xenos]] [[pirates]] and Larzend led his Maniple in defending its worlds from the Xenos. After 10 years of doing so, Larzend's Maniple was able to reestablish contact with the 183rd Fleet and the Saraninent Conglomerate later eagerly joined the [[Imperium]]. Larzend was honoured for his service, under such extreme conditions, and he was granted the title, '''Warden of Saraninent''' by [[Legio Metalica]]. To this day, monuments to the Legio Metalica exist across all of the Conglomerate’s worlds and each one is dedicated to Larzend and his Maniple.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Adeptus Titanicus: Loyalist Legios]], pg. 83

