Umariel.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Umariel''' is an [[Interrogator-Chaplain]] in the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter]] and took part in the battle against the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] led by the [[Black Legion]] [[Chaos Lord]] [[Erasmus Krag]].{{Fn|1}}

==Hunt for the Fallen==
When evidence was discovered by the Dark Angels that pointed to a member of Krag's Warband to be a member of the [[Fallen]], the Chapter mobilized all available forces to track the Warband down. Under the command of [[Dark Angels Grand Master|Grand Master]] [[Sammael]], the Dark Angels tracked Krag's Warband to their outpost on a world near the [[Eye of Terror]] and launched a surprise attack. In the battle to come, the Dark Angles suffered massive causalities, as they attacked the Black Legion in force, as they did not know who amongst the Warband was the Fallen.{{Fn|1}}  

Umariel led a squadron of [[Battle Brother]]s in the battle and many gave their lives to save the Chaplain when he came under concentrated fire from the Warband. Enraged Umariel would do much to avenge his Brothers' death, as the Warband was destroyed by the Dark Angels. Seeing the Warband's defeat was at hand, the Fallen, who had remained hidden throughout the battle, tried to escape the Dark Angels' grasp and nearly succeeded before he saw the Chaplain blocking his path. Realizing that the target of their hunt was in front of him, Umariel was filled with righteous fury and launched himself at the Fallen. After a brief battle, Umariel struck the Fallen down and immobilized him for interrogation at [[The Rock]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 397 (UK)]], pgs. 65-75

