'''Uriel Dios''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Scout|Scout]] attached to the [[4th Company (Ultramarines)|4th Company]].

==History==
Uriel was inducted into the Ultramarines shortly after the battle on [[Tarsis Ultra]], when the 4th Company needed to rebuild its numbers.  One of the final trials for [[Aspirant]]s to the Ultramarines was a bare-footed race over the [[Crown Mountains]] to the [[Fortress of Hera]] on [[Macragge]].  Uriel was in the lead, but held back to help his friend, [[Janek Lycean]], who had dropped to his knees from wounds and exhaustion.  [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Learchus Abantes]], Acting-[[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the 4th, was impressed, announcing that what he wanted most from his new recruits were brothers who preferred to stand together rather than reach for victory.{{Fn|1a}}

Both Uriel and Janek were inducted into the 4th as Scouts.  They took part in the 4th's campaign on [[Espandor]] against an invading [[Ork]] [[Waaagh!]].{{Fn|1b}}  During the defense of [[Herapolis]], they fought on the ground level, defending the breach in the walls.{{Fn|1c}}

They later joined Scout Sergeant [[Issam|Issam's]] squad in its reconnaissance of [[Tarentus]] during the [[Invasion of Ultramar]].{{Fn|2}}

