Urson Grimjarl.wikitext:
{{SquatPortal}}
[[Image:UrsonGrimjarlArt.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Urson Grimjarl{{Fn|1b}}]]
'''Urson Grimjarl''' is a [[Bounty Hunter]] from the [[Ironhead Squat]]s, on the planet [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].
He left his native [[Jardlan]] Holdfast long ago to roam the wasteland, hunting [[Ash Wastes Nomads]] for bounties. Over the decades, he has traveled the [[Great Equatorial Wastes]] and beyond, earning a reputation for his uncanny ability to track down and kill even the most elusive nomad raiders.{{Fn|1b}}

==Biography==
Years ago, Urson's father, [[Harro Grimjarl]], offered him stewardship of [[Jardlan]] when the elder Squat sought to take the [[Graven Path]] and join the elders who tend to the Ironhead [[Ancestral Core]]. Urson declined, passing the leadership of the Clan to another Squat family of Jardlan.{{Fn|1b}} 

He and his older brother [[Orrin Grimjarl]] are among the last survivors of the destroyed [[Jardlan]] stronghold. After a chance encounter with Orrin, Urson decided to help guide his younger brother and his companions back to their holdfast, perhaps as a final favor to Harro or because, like Orrin, he sought vengeance against those who had destroyed their lineage.{{Fn|1b}} 

Urson is a dangerous and cunning adversary. Survival as a nomad hunter in the ash wastes demands the ability to outmaneuver one's foes.{{Fn|1b}} 

==Equipment==
He is armed with a Jardlan [[Longshot Hunting Rifle]] and a pair of [[Techmite Occuli]]s, mechanical companions equipped with whirring fans and an array of pict lenses to locate hidden enemies.{{Fn|1b}} 

