Vahaera.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Vahaera''' is a [[Bondswoman]] of [[House Griffith]] sworn to Lady [[Ahdgifa]]; they both serve in the [[Dragonsplice Lance]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The lance is among the [[Imperium]]'s forces that are defending [[Fortress 23-Alphus]] from a [[Tyranid]] invasion. During the course of the battle, the Dragonsplice began hunting down a [[Winged Hive Tyrant]] that had massacred hundreds of Imperial forces. Among the slain was the world's [[Imperial Commander]]; the lance's leader, [[Oderik Griffith]], vowed to her as she died that the Dragonsplice would kill the beast. Their hunt for the Tyrant led them to a canyon, where they found the Tyrant and a Tyranid swarm. As the battle between them began, the Dragonsplice's [[Bondsmen]] dealt with the Tyranid swarm's smaller organisms, while the [[Noble]]s fought its [[Carnifex]]es. Oderik meanwhile, charged directly towards the Tyrant.{{Fn|1}}

