He took part in the [[Third War for Armageddon]] and fought exemplary against the invading [[Orks]]. So much so, that Valarius was reassigned to a [[Crusade]] in the rim of the [[Galaxy]], due to it being highly likely to encounter [[Xenos]]. This Crusade was later among the [[Imperium]]'s forces that took part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Kith Campaign]], which fought against the invading [[Drukhari]].{{Fn|3}} However, Valarius was taken prisoner by the [[Xenos]], during one of the Campaign's battles, and it is not known what became of him afterwards.{{Fn|1}}
