Vallera Dresis.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Vallera Dresis''' was the [[Planetary Governor]] of [[Xariss]] in late [[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
When Xariss found itself in the path of the [[Tyranid]] [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]], the planet was believed doomed by [[Imperial]] authorities, who made no efforts to defend Xariss from invasion by the Tyranids. However, Governor Dresis was considered essential personnel, and so a small [[Astra Militarum|Militarum]] task force led by [[Commissar]] [[Decius Krassus]] was tasked with [[Xariss Campaign|evacuating]] Dresis.{{Fn|1}}

When Commissar Krassus and his men reached the Governor's palace, however, they were attacked by [[Chaos Cultist|Dresis's servants]], who now sported strange [[tattoo]]s. They found that Dresis and her men were [[heretic]]s who had turned to the worship of [[Gods of Chaos|Dark Gods]] in search of salvation from the Tyranids.{{Fn|1}}

Despite the Governor's fall to [[Chaos]], Commissar Krassus insisted that the task force's orders were to extract Dresis and bring her to the authorities. [[Tempestor Prime]] [[Cadmur]] had his men [[tranq]] her and she was brought through the Tyranid swarms to the task force's evac point, where [[Valkyrie]]s of the [[99th Deltic Gorgonnes]] waited to bring them offworld. Dresis awoke on one of the Valkyries as they lifted off, Krassus's [[plasma pistol]] pointed directly at her face.{{Fn|1}}

