Vanderhecht.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Vanderhecht''' is the [[Planetary Governor]] of [[Trajan-III]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The [[Imperial]] world became endangered when it was projected that [[Trajan-III]] lay in the path of a [[Black Crusade]]. However, the Imperium's efforts to defend the world were undermined when insurgents from Trajan-III's population seized the vast underground '''Safehaven''' storage facility. It was discovered that some of Trajan-III's most prominent citizens were among the insurgents, but whether they had taken Safehaven to save themselves from the Black Crusade or to aid it was not known.{{Fn|1}}

[[Inquisitor]] [[Helbrandt Grimm]] was then sent to reclaim the storage facility with the aid of the [[Astra Militarum]]. However, after they infiltrated Safehaven, Grimm discovered that the insurgents were in fact a [[Genestealer Cult]], whose [[Genestealer Magus|Magnus]] was Vanderhecht's wife. The Cult was attempting to build a beacon that would summon a [[Hive Fleet]] to Trajan-III, but Grimm used a [[Hunting Lance]] to set off a massive explosion that destroyed Safehaven. The Cult members within the underground facility were killed, but it is not known if Vanderhecht was among them or even if the [[Planetary Governor]] was part of the Cult.{{Fn|1}}

