Vantix.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Vantix''' was an [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Hetaeron Guard|Companion]]-[[Shield-Captain|Captain]] and was among its forces that took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Near the end of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]], he was chosen to join the [[Emperor]]'s [[teleportation]] attack upon the traitorous [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' flagship, the [[Vengeful Spirit]]. Vantix was placed in Proconsul [[Caecaltus Dusk]]'s [[Shield Company]] which was to act as the Emperor's bodyguards during the battle with the [[Traitor]]s. However disaster struck, when their teleportation went awry and separated the Emperor and Dusk's Shield Company from the other [[Imperial]] forces now aboard the Vengeful Spirit.{{Fn|1}} 

This was done by [[Horus]]' will and the [[Warmaster]] then used the power of [[Chaos]], to convince the [[Custodes]] that the [[Emperor]] was a corrupt monster and must die at their hands order to save the [[Imperium]]. Blood than began to pour from their eyes and while some were able to resist Horus and collapsed afterwards, many of the [[Shield Company]] turned on their Lord and began attacking Him. Though some of these Custodes were aware of what was going on, they could not stop themselves and the Emperor was forced to kill them in order to defend Himself. A lamenting Vantix was among the many who died at the Emperor's hands and was shred into ribbons by his Lord's [[Emperor's Lightning Claw|power claw]], after he drove his [[Power Sword|Warblade]] into the Emperor's ribs.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
