{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Vardoman Plosk''' was a Lord [[Magos]] [[Explorator]] of the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]].{{Fn|1}}

Hailing from the world of [[Triplex Phall]], Plosk eventually came to command his own [[Explorator Fleet]] from the factory vessel ''[[Excommentum Incursus]]''. He became famous for his discoveries in [[Archaeotech]] and [[STC]]'s.{{Fn|1a}} He eventually became interested in the [[Space Hulk]] ''[[Death of Integrity]]'', believing it contained an STC data core. To that end he was able to organize an expedition with the [[Blood Drinkers]] and [[Novamarines]] in clearing it of [[Genestealer]]s and recovering the STC core. At the center of the ''Death of Eternity'' they discovered the ancient vessel-[[A.I.]] ''[[Spirit of Eternity]]'' and forced to flee. Plosk was able to make it back to the [[Space Marine]] vessels with portions of the STC's data before the ''Spirit of Eternity'' fled into the [[Warp]].{{Fn|1a}}

Eventually Plosk was able to become a [[High Lord of Terra]].{{Fn|1b}}

