Vared.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion's]] [[11th Chapter (Ultramarines Legion)|Eleventh Chapter]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|3}}


==Biography==
Vared took part in the Great Crusade, leading his Chapter in the [[Battle of Thoas]].{{Fn|1}}

At one point, Vared commanded the Ultramarines' garrison on the planet [[Molech]]. Some time before the [[Horus Heresy]], Vared and his forces were rotated out and returned to [[Macragge]], being replaced by a new force under [[Castor Alcade]].{{Fn|3}}

He later joined the muster at [[Calth]] and was on his [[Primarch|Primarch's]] flagship, the ''[[Macragge's Honour]]'', when the [[Word Bearers]] Legion [[Battle for Calth|turned upon the Ultramarines]].  Vared was present on the bridge of ''Macragge's Honour'' when [[Roboute Guilliman|Guilliman]] contacted his Brother and confronted [[Lorgar]] about his treachery — right before the Word Bearers' Primarch  summoned a [[Daemon]] that caused the flagship's bridge to explode.  Though the Chapter Master survived the explosion, Vared saw Guilliman being pulled out into space and attempted to save his Primarch, but failed and was pulled out into space as well.{{Fn|2a}}

Though Guilliman was eventually able to make his way back to the ''Macragge's Honour''{{Fn|2b}}, Vared was never seen again.{{Fn|2a}}

