Varon (Blood Angels).wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Varon''' was a [[Codicier]] in the [[Blood Angels]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was attached to the [[Space Marine Company|Company]] of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Tycho]], when they were tasked with quarantining the [[Hive World]] [[Orilan]]. Though the Company was ordered to destroy any ships that escaped from Orilan, which had become [[Chaos|corrupted]] by [[Daemon]]s of [[Tzeentch]], Tycho led a squadron aboard one such ship when the [[Inquisitor]] [[Ramius Stele]] contacted their [[Frigate]] and requested their aid. This was after a Daemon from Orilan had boarded the Inquisitor's ship and began mutating it.{{Fn|1}}

When Tycho and his squadron returned to the [[Blood Angels]]' [[Frigate]], they brought back [[Ramius Stele|Stele]] and a small number of passengers they had been able to save. As Varon neared the passengers, however, his [[psychic]] powers enabled him to see that one of them had become infected by the [[Daemon]], that had attacked the [[Inquisitor]]'s ship. The [[Codicier]] shouted out a warning to his [[Battle Brothers]] about the Daemon, but it was unfortunately too late, as it erupted from the passenger and easily killed Varon. The Daemon then began a massacre aboard the Frigate.{{Fn|1}}

