Varzival Czervantes.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Varzival Czervantes{{Fn|1}}, the Knight Resplendent,''' was the [[Chapter Master|Chapter Magister]] of the [[Angels Resplendent]], when the [[Undying Martyr]] arrived on their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]]{{Fn|2}} [[Malpertuis]] and turned them into the [[Angels Penitent]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
However the [[Chapter Master|Chapter Magister]] was away campaigning, with the [[First Company]], when this occurred and so was unable to prevent the Resplendent from coming under the [[Undying Martyr|Martyr]]'s sway. Following that, the last anyone heard from Czervantes was shortly before the [[Chapter]] underwent the [[Great Purge]], that led them to become the [[Angels Penitent]]. A decade after that event, [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Montaig]] believed himself to be the only Angel who secretly refused to embrace the Martyr's teachings and still held on to the hope that the [[Chapter Master|Chapter Magister]] will return. When he does, Montaig is convinced Czervantes will be able to redeem the Chapter and restore them back into the [[Angels Resplendent]] once more.{{Fn|2}}  

Their former [[Chief Librarian|Chief Architect]] [[Athanazius]], however, was convinced that Czervantes and the [[First Company]] still lived. He believed they garrisoned a world of fire and nightmares, which had left them ignorant of their Chapter’s fall.{{Fn|1}} 

