'''Ve'meth''' is a [[Daemon Prince]] of [[Nurgle]].{{Fn|1a}}


==History==
Ve'Meth was a Daemon Prince who would move in real space, spreading a empire of decay by conquering world after world, turning them into plague worlds. He was described as a insect god and sentient disease, that didn't have a single body but instead would inhabit hundreds of host bodies simultaneously.{{Fn|1a}} He was banished back into the [[Warp]] by the original [[Soul Drinkers]] [[Chapter]] on the latest of the worlds to be added to his dominion, leading to the collapse of his empire. {{Fn|1b}}

==Wargear==
