'''Veirsturm''' is an [[Unnumbered Sons]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], in [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Primus]]' [[Battle Group Retributus]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
It was sent by [[Lord Commander]] [[Guilliman]] to free the worlds of the [[Iron Veil (Region)|Iron Veil]], from the grips of the [[Night Lords]]. Veirsturm's [[Space Marine Company|Company]] was among [[Battle Group Retributus|Retributus]]' forces that were sent to free the [[Hive World]] [[Caldon IV]]. When they arrived, though, its Capital [[Hive]] '''Holkenved''' surrendered to the Battle Group. It would be the only one, though, and Retributus used the Hive as a base to begin reclaiming the world. However as the Battle Group was transporting its forces to the Hive, they were ambushed by a large Night Lords [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] led by the [[Dreadmaster]]. Rather than fight the [[Chaos Lord]]'s fleet, though, the Battle Group acted as if they were fleeing. Retributus' commanders sought to draw in the Warband into attacking Holkenved, so that it could be destroyed and the Battle Group left its forces and the Hive's [[PDF]], there as bait. In order to make the ruse as believable as possible, however, the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] held his [[Unnumbered Sons]] back from the frontlines of the battle. Despite the Night Lords overwhelming their comrades and the PDF, Veirsturm would not give the order for his Company to attack, until the Night Lords were deep within the Hive.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The Wolftime (Novel)]] Chapter 1

