Veit Morena.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Veit Morena''' was a [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] of the [[Armageddon Steel Legion]] active during the [[Third War for Armageddon]]. He had command of the [[22nd Armageddon Steel Legion|22nd regiment's]] 12th company.{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
At one point in the war, Morena's squadron was recalled from [[Anaon]] to [[Hive Tartarus]]. At this time, they had the honour of escorting the legendary [[Commissar]] [[Sebastian Yarrick]]; Yarrick was also due to return to Tartarus, but a pitched battle between [[Ork]] and [[Imperial]] aircraft had erupted nearby, preventing him from travelling back via air. Instead Yarrick joined Morena aboard his [[Leman Russ Vanquisher]], the ''[[Storm of the Wastes]]''.{{Fn|1}}

While en route, the 22nd spotted a column of [[Gargant]]s heading for Tartarus. In order to avoid them, Morena directed the 22nd eastwards off the main route so they could use a hilly region to provide cover. While Morena had [[Jaro Berne|Berne]] [[vox]] a report to Tartarus to warn them, however, they were attacked by Ork [[bomber]]s. The squadron was wiped out, and ''Storm of the Wastes'' was blasted upside down with Yarrick as the only survivor.{{Fn|1}}

