Verena Armenii.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Verena Armenii''' was an [[Order of the Argent Shroud|Argent Shroud]] [[Canoness]], who led a battlehost to save the relics of [[Imperial Saint|Saint]] [[Helena (Imperial Saint)|Helena]] from the [[Ork]] invaded [[Hive World]], [[Acheron IV]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Hive World]] had nearly been brought to its knees by [[Waaagh!]] [[Uggrot]], but Verena did not attempt to aid [[Acheron IV]]'s embattled [[Imperium]] defenders. The [[Canoness]] deemed the recovery of the relics to be more important and instead, led her battlehost's drop-ships directly to the '''Angel Spire''' outpost. It was there, that the '''Shrine of [[Imperial Saint|Saint]] [[Helena (Imperial Saint)|Helena]]''' was located, but as they neared it, the battlehost saw the outpost had been overrun by the [[Orks]]. Verena still ordered the battlehost to search the Saint's Shrine anyways, as she hoped to recover some of Helena's relics. Upon landing, they were immediately attacked by the Orks who still held the area, but the battlehost was able to drive the [[Xenos]] back from the Shrine. This soon changed, though, when [[Warboss]] [[Grog Chewtops]] arrived and rallied the Orks, into launching a ferocious attack on the battlehost's position. In the desperate carnage that followed, the Xenos gained the upper hand and the battlehost began to be cut down in greater numbers. Verena herself was sent sprawling to the ground, after the [[Immolator]] beside her exploded from an Ork attack. Before the Canoness was able to pick her self up, however, Verena was surrounded and killed by the Xenos. However the Orks were defeated, after [[Seraphim Superior]] [[Camille]] discovered the Saint's [[Sword of Saint Helena|sacred sword]] and killed Warboss Chewtops with it. This caused the Orks to flee and Verena's surviving battlehost, was able to escape with the recovered relics.{{Fn|1}}   

==Source==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 382 (UK)]], pg. 84 - ''The Desecration of Angel Spire''
