Veritas Van Skorvold.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Veritas Van Skorvold''' was one of the heads of the [[Van Skorvold Cartel]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Veritas and her brother, [[Callisthenes Van Skorvold]], inherited ownership of the cartel following the death of their father, [[Diego Van Skorvold|Diego]].{{Fn|1a}} Veritas suffered from a rare mutation that stunted her growth, effectively halting her aging and giving her the appearance of a prepubescent despite being over 40 years old.{{Fn|1b}} 

When the Van Skorvold cartel came under scrutiny from the [[Administratum]], following persistent rumours that the cartel was engaged in illegal [[mutant]] smuggling, the [[Van Skorvold Star Fort|cartel's headquarters]] were raided by the [[Soul Drinkers]]. As the Soul Drinkers' [[Space Marine Commander|Commander]], [[Caeon]], led a force in storming the fort's bridge, he was stabbed in the leg by Veritas, whom he had mistaken for a servant girl due to her size.{{Fn|1a}} This act would eventually kill Caeon{{Fn|1c}}, as Veritas's [[Digital weapon|digital]] [[needler]] contained a cocktail of [[Xenos|xeno-toxins]] potent enough to overwhelm even the genhanced biology of a [[Space Marine]].{{Fn|1b}}

Veritas was detained on board the star fort, and was still there when the Soul Drinkers were forced to destroy it. She escaped the fort's destruction in a [[saviour pod]]. After three days, she was picked up by the [[cruiser]] ''[[Hydranye Ko]]'' and arrested.{{Fn|1d}}

