Veur.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was an [[Ironwrought]] of the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] and a member of [[Clan Morragul]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. He served in the 1st squad of the Devastator Company of the Order Tredecimii{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Veur.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Veur{{Fn|1}}]]
Veur was aboard the ''[[Red Talon]]'' when the [[Dropsite Massacre]] occurred on [[Isstvan V]]. As [[Autek Mor]], master of the Morragul Clan, ordered his ship to attempt to breach through the firestorm to reach Isstvan V, the infamously powerful [[Grand Cruiser]] succeeded in punching through the battle, but took such heavy damage it was forced to bypass Isstvan V and flee, managing to escape, unlike many of the Iron Hands ships that would later arrive. During the desperate void battle, Veur was part of the heavy support squads who repelled dozens of separate boarding attacks from all sides on the ''Red Talon'' and were instrumental in slaughtering any who attempted to wrest control of the ship, taking heavy losses while doing so.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The Horus Heresy Book Two - Massacre ]], pg. 185

