Vileth Rey Aggranoza.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Vileth Rey Aggranoza''' is a [[Rogue Trader]], who operates in the [[Eastern Fringe]] and has frequent dealings with the [[Forge World]] [[Delphi (Forge World)|Delphi]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
This is due to Aggranoza believing that Delphi is one of the few safe places in the Fringe that will not question too deeply as to how he acquired his items. As a result, the Rogue Trader goes to the Forge World whenever he has found something strange he wishes to sell. Delphi's rulers, known as the [[Charities of Delphi]], have now developed such goodwill towards the Rogue Trader that they will freely repair and refuel his ships whenever he visits. For his part, Aggranoza believes them to be charitable and wise, though he questions how the Fabricator Generals seem to know when his contacts have some unusual treasure. It is a question that he has been unable to answer so far.{{Fn|1}}

