Villix.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''Villix the Balefiend''' is a dreaded [[Lord Discordant]] of the [[Black Legion]], who has the [[Daemon]] [[Ul'o'cca]] bound into his [[Impaler Chainglaive]]. He is currently among the [[Traitor Legion]]'s forces that have come to the [[Nachmund Rift War|aid]] of the [[Fallen Knight World]] [[Dharrovar]], after it was [[Siege of Dharrovar|invaded]] by the [[Imperium]] in [[M42]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the course of their [[Siege of Dharrovar|attack]], the [[Black Legion]] laid the [[House Terryn]] [[Knight Castellan]] [[Iron Duty]] low, forcing it to undergo repairs. As the war for [[Dharrovar]] continued, the Iron Duty was taken to a subterranean [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] of [[Mars]] compound, on the [[Fallen Knight World]], where work began to bring the Knight Castellan back to the war front. During the course of its repair, though, Villix invaded the compound with an elite force of the Black Legion, intent on corrupting the Iron Duty's [[Throne Mechanicum]]. If they could do so, then the Knight Castellan would aid the Black Legion in destroying the Imperials on Dharrovar. The Adeptus Mechanicus' [[Skitarii]] in the compound, however, are now fighting Villix's forces to prevent that from happening.{{Fn|1}} 

