Vincente Sixx.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
[[Image:VincenteArt.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Vincente Sixx]]
'''Vincente Sixx''' was a member of the [[Raven Guard]] legion during the [[Horus Heresy]]. He was an [[apothecary]] and became [[Chief Apothecary]] after the Dropsite Massacre. He is noted to be one of the youngest apothecaries in the legion, with only 15 years in the [[Apothecarion]].{{Fn|1}}

===Biography===
{{Spoiler|source=Deliverance Lost (Novel)}}
As Chief Apothecary, he liaised the rebuilding of the legion along with [[Magos]] Nexin as they made new Space Marines dubbed "[[Raptor (Raven Guard)|Raptors]]", from their [[Primarch]]'s genetic material.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Battle of Ravendelve]] Sixx was killed by an [[Alpha Legion]] operative under the guise of Commander [[Solaro An]] as he tried to secure the gene-seed project. He was found by [[Navar Hef]] and a few other Raptors before dying and told them of the traitors in Ravendelve and asked them to secure the gene-seed with his personal command key, which he gave to Navar.{{Fn|1}}

