Vincius.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Vincius''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]], who in [[M42]] led a strike force to destroy the [[Chaos Lord|Chaos Warlord]] [[Hargaal Xere]]'s forces on [[Bakhar Prime]], after they established a stronghold there.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
After they arrived in the [[Eastern Fringes]]' [[Bakhar Sector]], though, [[Hargaal Xere|Xere]]'s forces began to attack worlds that were close by to [[Bakhar Prime]]. Because of this, when the [[Industrial World]] [[Zanzamon]] sent a plea for aid, the strike force could only spare the [[Assault Intercessor]] squadron of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Gideon (Ultramarines)|Gideon]] to answer it. However when they arrived, Gideon's squadron discovered Zanzamon was in fact a [[Necron Tomb World]] of the [[Szarekhan Dynasty]] and it was being attacked by a small force of the Dynasty's Necrons This was in fact a vanguard of the legions beneath the world's surface, which had begun to awaken. Gideon quickly requested aid to deal with this emerging threat, but due to its battles with Hargaal Xere, it would be weeks or months before the strike force's reinforcements arrived.{{Fn|1}} 

