Viola von Castellan.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Viola von Castellan''' is the [[Rogue Trader Seneschal|Seneschal]] of the [[House von Castellan]] [[Rogue Trader House]], which is led by her older brother [[Cleander von Castellan]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
They are both scions of a wealthy [[Xarxis Plethis]] aristocratic family{{Fn|1}}, whose estate was sold by [[Cleander von Castellan|Cleander]] after he inherited his family's [[Warrant of Trade]]. He used the resources to buy a starship and began his career as a [[Merchant Fleet|merchant]]{{Fn|2}} and Viola became his [[Rogue Trader Seneschal|Seneschal]]{{Fn|1}}. However Cleander's travels led him to encounter no less than four non-[[Imperial]] worlds, with which he opened exclusive trade negotiations. It was at this point, though, that [[Inquisitor]] [[Covenant]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]] caught up with him. In order to avoid being punished for failing to disclose the whereabouts of the [[Xenos]] worlds, Cleander signed an agreement that pledged himself and his ship to Covenant{{Fn|2}}. The arraignment between them also puts [[House von Castellan]]'s staff and resources at the [[Inquisitor]]'s command if need be. And since she serves as the House's Seneschal, Viola assists Covenant as well, when the Inquisitor calls upon her brother for aid.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
