Visionary.wikitext:
{{SlaaneshPortal}}
The '''Visionary''' is a [[Flawless Host]] [[Chaos Lord]], who led an [[Pyrocataclysm of Vilidad Prime|invasion]] of the [[Mining World]] [[Vilidad Prime]] in 006.[[M40]] due to the population's lack of beauty.{{Fn|1}}

With only the [[122nd Imeldan Destriers]] [[Regiment]] to defend the world, the Flawless Host would have destroyed Vilidad's population, had the [[Legion of the Damned]] not appeared. The otherworldly warriors then began killing many of the Flawless Host, which led the Visionary to launch an attack with a hundred [[Slaanesh]] [[Daemons]]. Even with his Daemonic allies, however, the Visionary was no match for the Legion's might. Their [[Warp|etheric flames]] soon destroyed the Daemons and the Visionary and surviving Flawless Host then fled Vilidad, rather than risk defeat or being disfigured by the Legion's fire.{{Fn|1}}

