Viton Tahn.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a veteran [[Xiphon Interceptor]] pilot in the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Great Crusade]] and in its later years he became something of a legend to his peers in [[Clan Morragul]].  He was stationed aboard the ''[[Red Talon]]'', when it took part in the [[Dropsite Massacre]] and Tahn suffered grievous wounds, as he attempted to breakthrough the Traitors' blockade above [[Isstvan V]].  He was able to guide his damaged Interceptor back to the ''Red Talon'', but it was thought that Tahn's wounds would force him to be interred within a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]], in order to survive.  However, his fellow pilots suggested an unconventional alternative and once Tahn consented to the operation, an [[Apothecarion]] grafted his most vital organs to his Xiphon Interceptor.  The operation was a success and Tahn remained the most skilled pilot amongst the ''Red Talon's'' orbital assault wings.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
