Vivica Sautine.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Vivica Sautine''' was a [[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] of the 57th [[Armoured Regiment]] of the [[Perlia]]n [[Planetary Defence Force]] during the [[Siege of Perlia]] in 929.[[M41]].

==Biography==
Sautine and her tank crew belonged to an all-female unit, the "Vixens," which were as rare among [[PDF]] forces as among the [[Imperial Guard]]. Their tank took its name from this unit, and featured a crude drawing of a "red furred" creature in a uniform on the side.{{Fn|1a}}

When the [[Imperial]] forces on Perlia's western continent were overrun by the [[ork]]s of [[Waaagh! Korbul]], they scattered into random elements that conducted guerilla actions against the orks. Sautine, left in command of a single [[Leman Russ Battle Tank]], the ''Vixen'', was forced to run when the supply base she was heading for was occupied by the orks.{{Fn|1a}}

Fleeing to an alternate base, pursued by orks, she joined up with the ''ad hoc'' force led by [[Commissar]] [[Ciaphas Cain]]. Though Cain's force was preparing to move out and had already booby-trapped the supply cache, [[Felicia Tayber]] managed to snatch a few pallets of shells for the tank's [[Battle Cannon]], which were used to great effect to annihilate the incoming orks.{{Fn|1a}}

Sautine's Leman Russ was the first armoured vehicle Cain's force acquired, but several more joined the force in the following weeks, and Cain put her in charge of his armour contingent.{{Fn|1b}} She was instrumental in the battle at the Valley of Daemons{{Fn|1c}}, and survived when the force finally broke through to the Imperial lines.{{Fn|2}}

Decades later, in 999.[[M41]], Cain reluctantly led Perlia's forces again during the [[Second Siege of Perlia|Second Siege]]. Recalling memories of the First Siege, Cain saw a Leman Russ and half-expected Sautine to pop out of the turret, only to remember that she had died of old age years earlier.{{Fn|2}}

