Vlokarion.wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Vlokarion''' was an infamous [[Dark Eldar]] [[Haemonculus]] of [[Commorragh]], said to be second only to [[Urien Rakarth]] in accomplishments.{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
Vlokarion was fascinated by the [[Exodite]] [[Eldar]], believing that during [[The Fall]] the racial soul of the Eldar was divided, each portion embracing an aspect of the Eldar nature. Believing that [[Craftworld]] Eldar embraced the discipline of [[Asuryan]], Vlokarion also theorized that the Exodites embraced the purity of [[Isha]]. As a result, Vlokarion believed that the dark energies gathered from the torments of an Exodite Eldar would be far more potent than those harvested from "lesser races" such as [[human]]s, allowing Dark Eldar figures deceased for potentially thousands of years to be resurrected.{{Fn|1}}

