Volkus Goraddin.wikitext:
{{SonsOfHorusPortal}}
'''Volkus Goraddin''' was a [[Sons of Horus]] [[Justaerin]] [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]], who served as his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s emissary on the [[Death Guard]]'s [[Homeworld]], [[Barbarus]], when it was [[Siege of Baal|invaded]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He would then subsequently command the [[Sons of Horus]] forces on the '''Plains of Orthrya''', as the [[Loyalist]] [[Primarch]]s [[El'Jonson]] and [[Russ]] led a attack upon it. The [[Traitor]]s were then overwhelmed due to the might of the two Primarchs and near the end of the battle, El'Jonson led his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] upon Goraddin's position. The [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] made ready to meet the [[Dark Angels]]' Primarch charge, but found his path blocked by one of El'Jonson's [[Contemptor Dreadnought]]s. As his forces guarded themselves for the Primarch's attack, the Goraddin, [[Dark Apostle|Chaplain]] [[Haeton Fahl]] and the Praetor's [[Terminator]] escort attacked the Contemptor. Despite being outnumbered, however, the Dreadnought slew several of the Terminators, as nearby El'Jonson led the Dark Angels in cutting through the Sons of Horus. The Primarch's Legion then destroyed Goraddin's forces and the Praetor died at their hands.{{Fn|1}}
==Canon Conflict==
[[White Dwarf 481]] states that ''Volkus Goraddin'' is the [[Sons of Horus]]' emissary to [[Barbarus]]{{Fn|1}}. However [[White Dwarf 478]] states that [[Arbras Haax]] holds that position.{{Fn|2}} 

