He was stationed aboard the [[Battle Barge]] ''[[Macragge's Fury]]'' when it received a beacon signal from a recently-activated [[STC]] fragment on [[Tahnicus Mundi]]. The Battle Barge's Commander sought to claim it for the [[Imperium]] and Thassius volunteered to lead a strike force to recover the STC. However the [[Death Guard]] forces of [[Dolgoth Sepk]] and the [[Ork]] [[Evil Sunz]] forces of [[Kroglin]] have also arrived on the planet to claim the STC for their factions. They are now fighting each other for the right to do so, but the [[Primaris Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] has vowed to destroy the STC should it be at risk of falling into their hands.{{Fn|1}}

