Von Kalda.wikitext:
{{EmperorsChildrenPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was an [[Chaos Space Marine Apothecary|Apothecary]] of the [[Emperor's Children]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
A follower of [[Fabius Bile]] and [[Eidolon]]'s [[Equerry]], following the [[Battle of Isstvan III|fall]] of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] on [[Isstvan III]] Von Kalda began to explore the limits of torture, mutilation, and [[Daemon]]ic rituals. Von Kalda made a pact with the [[Keeper of Secrets]] [[Manushya-Rakshsasi]]: in exchange for knowledge of the [[Jaghatai Khan|Great Khan's]] location, Von Kalda offered up the as-yet-untransformed [[Prefector]] of the [[Palatine Blades]], [[Ravasch Cario]]. To Von Kalda's horror, however, the daemons found another target during the [[Battle of Catallus]]: his own commander [[Azael Konenos]]. Escaping Von Kalda's lab, the daemons possessed Konenos and the entire crew of the ''[[Proudheart]]''.{{Fn|1}}

Later, Von Kalda appeared as part of [[Fulgrim]]'s elite guard in the [[Siege of Terra]] and had the face of a child. He served as the [[Equerry]] to [[Eidolon]] during this time. During the battle for the [[Saturnine Gate]], Von Kalda was slain by the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Primarch]], [[Rogal Dorn]].{{Fn|2}}

