'''Vorarr the Infernal''' is a winged [[Slaanesh]] [[Daemon Prince]], who is allied with the [[Black Legion]].{{Fn|1}}

==Hunt for the Fallen==
Vorarr was part of a warband led by the Black Legion [[Chaos Lord]] [[Erasmus Krag]], when it came under attack by the [[Dark Angels]] in their search for a [[Fallen]] hidden amongst them. Vorarr did not immediately go to his allies' aid, instead waiting until the battle was nearly ended before deciding to intervene and attack the Dark Angels. Though he caused a large number of casualties amongst them as he soared over the battlefield, he was eventually shot out of the sky by the Sons of the Lion. After he crashed to the ground, Vorarr was dazed and had little time to recover his senses before he was struck multiple times by [[bolter]] fire from the Dark Angels and banished back to the [[Warp]].{{Fn|1}}

==The [[Blood Purge of Crixos]]==
Vorarr took part in the Black Legion's invasion of the [[Hive World]] [[Crixos]] which left it in ruins. Before the Black Legion could destroy the last [[hive]] on its surface, though, they were attacked by an [[Imperium]] battlegroup hastily dispatched to stop them.{{Fn|2a}} In the ensuing battle between the two forces, Vorarr greatly aided the Black Legion by summoning numerous [[Daemon]]s from the Warp to attack the battlegroup. It wasn't enough, however, and Vorarr was struck down by massive fire from the battlegroup, sending him back to the Warp, with the Black Legion's forces being defeated soon after.{{Fn|2b}}

