Vorghor.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}{{WorldEatersPortal}}
'''Vorghor the Brutal''' is a [[Khorne]] [[Daemon Prince]], who is a member of the [[Gore-forged]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The former [[Chaos Space Marine]] has only recently joined, but has amassed a group of followers within the [[Gore-forged]], who are known as the [[Iron Butchers (Warband)|Iron Butchers]]. The only way a Gore-forged leader maintains his position is by dominating his followers, but should a new champion join the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], then a power struggle is all but guaranteed to break out. Such was the case when Vorghor joined and it is only a matter of time until the [[Daemon Prince]] attempts to physically wrest control of the Gore-forged from its current leader, [[Ar'ghurak]].{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
The [[Gore-forged]] and the [[Iron Butchers (Warband)|Iron Butchers]] were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee [[James Ashbey]], for the [[White Dwarf]] magazine's 2023 '''A Tale of Four Warlords''' competition.{{Fn|1}} 
