Vorhel.wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Vorhel the Masked Butcher''', was a member of the [[Drukhari]] species.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He had been the scourge of the [[Imperium]]'s outer [[Colony World|colonies]] for several decades, though in recent years Vorhel began encroaching further into its domain. During these attacks, the [[Drukhari]] terrorized Imperial citizens and butchered its forces. He was declared an Omega-level threat by the Imperium for this and all haste was ordered to kill Vorhel. He was later among the Drukhari forces{{Fn|1}} that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the Imperium launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the [[Xenos]]{{Fn|2}} and Vorhel would become one of its priority targets. He was later killed in battle with the Imperium's forces during the conflict.{{Fn|1}} 
