Vynnsakar.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
'''Vynnsakar''' was a [[Salamanders]] warlord in the [[True Flame]] [[Blackshield]] warband, during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
[[Image:Vynnsakar.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Vynnsakar{{Fn|1}}]]
As the conflict raged, Vynnsakar sought to reforge the embattled [[Imperium]]{{Fn|1}} by scouring any corruption he found within it. The Warlord is also known to have taken part in the later stages of the [[Pale Stars campaign (Horus Heresy)|Pale Stars Campaign]],{{Fn|2}} as the region of space was ravaged by [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' hordes.{{Fn|3}} This was known as '''Bleeding the Pale Stars'''{{Fn|4}} and the [[True Flame]]{{Fn|1}} were among the [[Blackshield]] warbands, that formed a temporary alliance with the ragtag [[Imperial]] forces that were fighting there.{{Fn|3}} During the campaign, though, Vynnsakar became targeted by the [[Alpha Legion]]'s [[First Captain]], [[Ingo Pech]], who was determined to kill him.{{Fn|3}} 
