{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Colonel]] '''Walde''' was the commanding officer of the [[29th Noctan Strike Force]] during the [[Third War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}}

In the course of the war, the [[Noctan Strike Forces]], including Walde and the 29th Noctans, took part in the defence of [[Acheron Hive]]. Even after the hive was largely occupied by the invading [[Ork]]s, Walde coordinated a number of lightning raids on the east face of the hive, dedicated to exterminating as many of the Orks as possible and disrupting any defence they may try to enact as the [[Imperial]] defenders of [[Armageddon]] try to retake the lost ground.{{Fn|1}}

