Warmund.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Warmund''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Lord Militant]], who oversaw its efforts to end the [[Malouri Uprising]] in [[M42]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
{{Spoiler|source= Traitor Rock (Novel)}}
Initially [[General]] [[von Horne]], had command of the [[Astra Militarum]] forces that invaded [[Malouri]] to reclaim the [[Imperial]] world. However, while most of the world was taken back from the rebel forces, their commander, '''Arch-Duke''' [[Holzhauer]], ordered them to retreat. The rebels then made their escape to the island fortress of '''Crannog Mons''' and blew the bridges connecting the island to Malouri's mainland. This prevented General von Horne's forces from directly attacking the fortress and instead a protracted siege commenced. However when the siege entered its 4th year, Warmund seemingly grew tired of von Horne's slow pace. In order to finally defeat Holzhauer's forces, the [[Lord Militant]] tasked the [[Cadian 101st]] Regiment with storming the island fortress.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Traitor Rock (Novel)]], Part 1 - Chapter 2

