{{LOVPortal}}
'''Warspeke''' is a [[Kâhl]] in the [[Greater Thurian League]], who commands the [[Warspeke Prospect|Warspeke's]] [[Prospect]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He fights with a mixture of skill and brute force, while his strategic wisdom, determination and martial might inspires Warspeke's warriors{{Fn|1b}}. Under his command the [[Kâhl]]'s [[Prospect]] has fought across the stars to secure valuable resources and technologies that are worth risking their lives for. Warspeke's warriors, however, have little patience for other species' protestations of prior ownership or rights. When this occurs, the Kâhl's Prospect will use force to swiftly seize what they want, once it becomes clear that their threats alone will not work.{{Fn|1a}}

