{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Webb''' was a [[Canoness]] of the [[Sisters of Battle]], who defended an [[Imperial]] bastion, alongside an inexperienced [[Space Marine]] of the [[Imperial Talons]] [[Chapter]], from the forces of the [[Black Legion]].{{Fn|1}}

