Willard.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Willard''' was a [[Captain (Imperial Guard)|Captain]] of one of the [[Roane Deepers]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] that took part in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1b}}

Willard was one of the officers who served under [[General]] [[Nash]] in the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], commanding a Roane contingent of three [[platoon]]s assigned to guard the [[Hass East Fort]]. In this capacity, he fought alongside [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]] [[Ceglan Varl|Varl]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1b}} He was killed in the Third [[Ferrozoica|Zoican]] Storm of [[Vervunhive]].{{Fn|1c}}


