Witch-Empress.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
The '''Witch-Empress''' was a powerful [[rogue psyker]] whose [[Psychic]] abilities allowed her to enthrall the minds of [[Vastoros]]'s population.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
With the population under her control, the [[Rogue Psyker]] ruled over [[Vastoros]] until [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Secundus]]'s [[Battle Group Erastus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group Erastus]] came to free the world. However, several sizable [[Chaos Warband]]s came to the Witch-Empress's aid, and with Vastoros's population under her control, the Battle Group faced daunting odds. This changed mere days before the [[Imperial|Imperium]]'s assault, though, when the [[High Lord of Terra|High Lord]] [[Morvenn Vahl]] brought a large force from the [[Order of the Argent Shroud]] to reinforce the battle group. Their combined forces then stormed Vastoros anew and, despite taking severe losses, the Imperials killed the Witch-Empress. With her death, the world's population was freed from the [[rogue psyker]]'s control and the Imperium regained control of Vastoros.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Black Templars (9th Edition)]], pg. 25 - ''Heimdel Crusade''

