Wulfric.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''Wulfric''' was a [[Pack Leader]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]], who served in the [[Wolf Lord]] [[Skaldir Ironfang]]'s [[Great Company]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[File:Wulfric.jpg|200px|thumb|right|Wulfric{{Fn|1}}]]
Among the battles he took part in, was the [[Great Hunt]] known as [[Operation Stormfrost]]. During the campaign, the [[Space Wolves]] attacked the '''Magnavox Ultima''' fortress of the [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]] [[Ghordane]] and [[Skaldir Ironfang|Ironfang]]'s [[Great Company]] was credited with defeating the [[Traitor Legion]]. Wulfric and the [[Longfang]] [[Egnar]] were noted to have served with distinction in the battle, with the Pack Leader's squadron having [[teleported]] directly into the Chaos Lord's command bunker. In their ensuing attack, the squadron was able to slaughter fifty World Eaters and completely dismantle the fortress' defensive command structure, before they were slain. Wulfric was later posthumously commended for his actions, after the Space Wolves were victorious.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*[[Operation Stormfrost]] and everything within it, was created by [[Tom Lauten]] and his team at [[Bright Light Studios]] for [[Games Workshop]]. It appeared in [[Inferno! 1]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Inferno! 1]], pgs. 42-43 — ''Operation Stormfrost''

