{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''X’hal Urus''' was a [[Word Bearers]] [[Chaos Sorcerer|Sorcerer]] who led the [[Lords of Desolation]] warband.{{Fn|1}}

An ancient [[Chaos Space Marine]], his warband had burned a thousand worlds in attacks against the [[Imperium]]. As Urus and his warband attacked the world of [[Sepharis Ultra]], they were surprised by the [[Black Templars]] landing in [[drop pods]] amongst them. In the ensuing battle the [[Emperor's Champion]] [[Reinhart]] struck Urus down, while he stabbed and killed the Champion in return. With his death, the [[daemon]]s allied with him were returned back to the [[warp]], allowing the Black Templars to achieve victory and destroy the Lords of Desolation.{{Fn|1}}

