X99 Bolus.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''X99 Bolus''' is a [[Magos]], [[datasmith]], and [[cybernetica]] cohort leader aboard the ''[[Zar-Quaesitor]]''. X99 is a follower of [[Belisarius Cawl]]. He is a robotics obsessive that is followed everywhere by a [[Kastelan]]-class battle automaton named [[Sigma Fidelis]].{{Fn|1a}}

X99's love of robotics is so great that he turned himself into a construct to all intents and purposes, and was now a collection of pistons and wires. He moved jerkily, far from the smooth, superior operations of Sigma Fidelis, whom he fastidiously keeps in peak condition and always seeks to improve.{{Fn|1a}}

